	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Apocalypsicas tuas conciones legi, compater <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>in domino charissime.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Non est, ut aliquid a me <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>expectes, quod in illas annotarim.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Vidi te ad <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>illas undique paratum et instructum accessisse; si <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quid desyderarem, iam antea significassem.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">De <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>numero annorum bestiae scriptum fratris cuiusdam ex <lb xml:id="p1z7"/><placeName ref="l2478">Sabaudia</placeName> habebam, quod puto te a domino <lb xml:id="p1z8"/><persName ref="p8018">Hallero</persName> accepisse, super quo tuum expecto iudi<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>cium.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Oro dominum, ut vicini vestri, quae scribis, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>tandem intelligant et a bestia deficiant, quam <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>prae aliis se defendere debere putant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Caeterum de <persName>Philippo</persName> quae significas, utinam sint firma.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Eadem hodie scripsit ad me d. <persName ref="p8055">Blaurerus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>sed a nonnulis vestrorum civium, ut opinor, accepta.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Quaeso, si certum aliquid acceperis, communices.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Quicquid sit, omnino noster est, id quod mihi <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ante annos quindecim certo persuasum fuit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Wyter ist min bitt an euch, wellent mich wissen <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>lassen, wie es by euch stande der holtzkhunst <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>halben, die h[err] <persName ref="p4082">Conradt Zwick</persName> an tag soll bringen.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Unßere herren haben sich der sach nichts wellen <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>annemen, welchs mir vast leid ist.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de">Das holtz <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>gestadt mich jars bitz uff die 10 cronen, ist <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ein zimlichs loch in myn besoldung.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Hab mich <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>vast gefreuwt; aber es will mich ansechen, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>als ob wir diser khumlicheit hie müsßen manglen.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Wanns sommer were, so müßt ich hinuß <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>zum herren <persName ref="p4082">Zwicken</persName> selb diser sachen halb.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de" ana="salute">Wa <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>er zu euch in die stat kheme, wellent ym <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>mynen gruß ansagen und dißes anzeigen; ich truw <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ym nach so vil vonn alter fründtschaft wegen, er <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>werden mich auch bedencken, darumb ich yn will <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>gepeten haben.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Optime vale, compater charissime, una cum tota domo tua, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>fratribus et amicis, d. <persName ref="p8171">Bibliandro</persName>, <persName ref="p2336">Bernardino</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z36"/><persName ref="p8111">Petro Martyre</persName>, <persName ref="p8011">Gualtero</persName> ac caeteris.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>te ac tuos mei omnes, praesertim <persName ref="p2207">Heinrychulus</persName> tuus.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/>Faxit dominus, ut annum hunc novum felici auspicio incho<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>etis, prosequamini ac terminetis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName> 1556. <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>decembris ultima.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8417">W[olfgangus] Musc[ulus]</persName>, compater tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Praestantissimo theologo <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>pastori vigilantissimo, domino <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>ac compatri suo <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>c<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>harissimo<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z9"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
